WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.840
In the name of the Father and of the Son and of the Holy Spirit, amen.

00:00:05.840 --> 00:00:13.600
The reading from the Sinaxadion for September 2, on which we commemorate the Holy Marjor

00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:16.510
Mamas.

00:00:16.510 --> 00:00:23.270
On the 2nd of the month, we celebrate the memory of the Holy Marjor Mamas.

00:00:23.270 --> 00:00:29.270
Saint Mamas came from Gangra in Paplegonia, Asia Minor.

00:00:29.270 --> 00:00:36.810
His parents, Thildotus and Rufina, were faithful Christians and confessors of the faith.

00:00:36.810 --> 00:00:41.990
They were cast into prisons by the pagans for refusing to deny Christ.

00:00:41.990 --> 00:00:48.350
And Mamas saw the light of day in a prison cell in the year 260.

00:00:48.350 --> 00:00:54.790
Since both his parents died in prison, the little orphan was adopted by a pious woman called

00:00:54.870 --> 00:00:59.910
Amiana, or Matrona, as some say.

00:00:59.910 --> 00:01:06.710
He became known as Mamas when he was a child because this word for his foster mother was

00:01:06.710 --> 00:01:09.030
ever on his lips.

00:01:09.030 --> 00:01:17.070
Before her death, she warned him above all else to keep himself from idols.

00:01:17.070 --> 00:01:24.110
When he was 15, Mamas was seized by soldiers in Caesarea, the chief city of Cappadocia,

00:01:24.110 --> 00:01:30.510
for refusing to sacrifice and for persuading his companions not to do so.

00:01:30.510 --> 00:01:39.230
He was sent first to Democritus, the governor, and then brought before the emperor, Aurelion.

00:01:39.230 --> 00:01:45.590
Seeing his tender years, the tyrant thought to win the boy over with swift flatteries,

00:01:45.590 --> 00:01:52.750
but soon discovered that Mamas' spirit was stronger than a diamond and a flame with divine

00:01:52.830 --> 00:01:57.710
zeal, more than the most fiery furnace.

00:01:57.710 --> 00:02:05.390
Aurelion was enraged to have a youth boldly hold his own against himself, the master of

00:02:05.390 --> 00:02:11.710
the largest part of the world, and had him cruelly beaten.

00:02:11.710 --> 00:02:20.310
Imagining that he had broken Mamas' spirit, Aurelion said, now simply say that you have sacrificed

00:02:20.310 --> 00:02:29.750
to the gods, and I will release you, neither in my heart nor with my lips, will I ever

00:02:29.750 --> 00:02:35.230
deny Christ my Savior, Mamas replied.

00:02:35.230 --> 00:02:42.110
On the contrary, I thank you, emperor, for these torments that enable me to love Christ

00:02:42.110 --> 00:02:49.680
more and to unite myself to my king who suffered for my salvation.

00:02:49.680 --> 00:02:53.960
Seeing torches were applied to his entire body.

00:02:53.960 --> 00:03:01.120
His limbs were battered with stones, and he was cast into the sea with a leaden weight

00:03:01.120 --> 00:03:03.680
around his neck.

00:03:03.680 --> 00:03:10.480
But an angel of the Lord transported him to a high mountain, overlooking the city.

00:03:10.480 --> 00:03:16.520
Glorifying God in ceaseless prayer, he lived there among the wild animals that offered him

00:03:16.520 --> 00:03:19.360
their milk for food.

00:03:19.360 --> 00:03:25.900
After some time, in the strength of a sign from God, Mamas went down the mountain and

00:03:25.900 --> 00:03:32.120
gave himself up to Alexander, the new governor of Cappadocia.

00:03:32.120 --> 00:03:39.320
He was again put to the torture which only availed to reveal in all its brilliance the grace

00:03:39.320 --> 00:03:43.280
of God in his soul and body.

00:03:43.280 --> 00:03:49.840
He was thrown into a fiery furnace where he remained like the three Hebrew children, telling

00:03:49.840 --> 00:03:57.520
forth the glory of God and protected from the consuming flames by a dew from heaven.

00:03:57.520 --> 00:04:05.320
In the end, pierced through with a fork, Mamas found the strength to make his new way out

00:04:05.320 --> 00:04:10.560
of the city where he surrendered his soul to God.

00:04:10.560 --> 00:04:17.560
When a voice was heard from on high, calling the martyr to rest from his labors, in the

00:04:17.560 --> 00:04:25.680
eternal habitations, through the prayers of our holy fathers, O Lord, Jesus Christ our

00:04:25.680 --> 00:04:29.220
God, have mercy on us and save us.
